{"id":"ab95f9ceb47742ee","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-socle.md","title":"Socle","display":"df-socle — Socle","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-socle","aliases":["58-df-socle"],"display":"df-socle — Socle","depends_on":["[[58-df-simple-module]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-socle"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-socle</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-socle — Socle"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e309a228bb19c798\" href=\"?note=e309a228bb19c798\" title=\"58-df-simple-module\">58-df-simple-module</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimpleModule}_S\\subseteq V^{9}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimpleModule}_S\\subseteq V^{9}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Socle}_S\\subseteq V^{10}\">\\(\\mathrm{Socle}_S\\subseteq V^{10}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StructuredSubmodule}_S\\subseteq V^{10}\">\\(\\mathrm{StructuredSubmodule}_S\\subseteq V^{10}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N,M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V\">\\(N,M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V\\)</span> (candidate socle and structured module data)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StructuredSubmodule}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{StructuredSubmodule}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimpleModule}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SimpleModule}_S\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e309a228bb19c798\" href=\"?note=e309a228bb19c798\" title=\"58-df-simple-module\">58-df-simple-module</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Socle}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Socle}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}socle}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Socle}_S(N;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\n\\begin{aligned}[t]\n&amp;\\mathrm{StructuredSubmodule}_S(N;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall S\\subseteq M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{StructuredSubmodule}_S(S;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{78pt}\\land\n\\mathrm{SimpleModule}_S(S,R,+_M\\upharpoonright S^2,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\upharpoonright(R\\times S))\n\\to S\\subseteq N\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall K\\subseteq M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{StructuredSubmodule}_S(K;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{32pt}\\land\\forall S\\subseteq M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{StructuredSubmodule}_S(S;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{107pt}\\land\n\\mathrm{SimpleModule}_S(S,R,+_M\\upharpoonright S^2,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\upharpoonright(R\\times S))\n\\to S\\subseteq K\\Bigr)\n\\to N\\subseteq K\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}socle}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Socle}_S(N;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\n\\begin{aligned}[t]\n&amp;\\mathrm{StructuredSubmodule}_S(N;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall S\\subseteq M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{StructuredSubmodule}_S(S;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{78pt}\\land\n\\mathrm{SimpleModule}_S(S,R,+_M\\upharpoonright S^2,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\upharpoonright(R\\times S))\n\\to S\\subseteq N\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall K\\subseteq M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{StructuredSubmodule}_S(K;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{32pt}\\land\\forall S\\subseteq M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{StructuredSubmodule}_S(S;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{107pt}\\land\n\\mathrm{SimpleModule}_S(S,R,+_M\\upharpoonright S^2,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\upharpoonright(R\\times S))\n\\to S\\subseteq K\\Bigr)\n\\to N\\subseteq K\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Soc}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Soc}(M)\\)</span> is the least structured submodule containing every simple submodule of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>.  This order-theoretic characterization replaces an unregistered “sum of a family of submodules” operator.</li>\n<li>The socle is the largest semisimple submodule of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>; maximality is a theorem following from the displayed sum construction.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rad}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rad}(M)\\)</span> is the intersection of all maximal submodules.</li>\n<li>No general identity <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Soc}(\\mathrm{Rad}(M))=0\">\\(\\mathrm{Soc}(\\mathrm{Rad}(M))=0\\)</span> holds without additional hypotheses on the ring or module.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-simple-module","status":"resolved","id":"e309a228bb19c798","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-simple-module]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-simple-module","status":"resolved","id":"e309a228bb19c798","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{StructuredSubmodule}_S$ and $\\mathrm{SimpleModule}_S$ (see [[58-df-simple-module]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{SimpleModule}_S\\subseteq V^{9}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Socle}_S\\subseteq V^{10}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StructuredSubmodule}_S\\subseteq V^{10}","display":false},{"tex":"N,M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StructuredSubmodule}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SimpleModule}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Socle}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}socle}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Socle}_S(N;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\n\\begin{aligned}[t]\n&\\mathrm{StructuredSubmodule}_S(N;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall S\\subseteq M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{StructuredSubmodule}_S(S;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&\\hspace{78pt}\\land\n\\mathrm{SimpleModule}_S(S,R,+_M\\upharpoonright S^2,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\upharpoonright(R\\times S))\n\\to S\\subseteq N\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall K\\subseteq M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{StructuredSubmodule}_S(K;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&\\hspace{32pt}\\land\\forall S\\subseteq M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{StructuredSubmodule}_S(S;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&\\hspace{107pt}\\land\n\\mathrm{SimpleModule}_S(S,R,+_M\\upharpoonright S^2,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\upharpoonright(R\\times S))\n\\to S\\subseteq K\\Bigr)\n\\to N\\subseteq K\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Soc}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rad}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Soc}(\\mathrm{Rad}(M))=0","display":false}],"bytes":2074,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1201","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-socle.md|58-df-socle]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["e309a228bb19c798"]}